  title: Work Order #4471
  author: 
  body: "NEXUS INSTITUTE -- FACILITIES MANAGEMENT\nWORK ORDER #4471\n\nLocation:
    Female Washroom, Main Building\nPriority: Low\nReported By: Janitorial Staff\n\nISSUE:\nIrregular
    water pressure in the female washroom drainage system.\nSlow drain times and
    intermittent blockage reported in the\nsecondary pipe network (junctions B4 through
    B9).\n\nACTION REQUIRED:\nManual flow test. Blockage clearance if required.\nAssigned
    to: Maintenance Team 2\nExpected completion: Within 5 business days.\n\n-------------------------------\nSTATUS:
    AUTO-CLOSED\n\nResolved by: ARBITEX\nNotes: Drainage flow within acceptable parameters.\n      
    Manual inspection is not required.\n\n-- Automatically processed by ARBITEX Facilities
    Protocol v2.1"
  noteType: 0
